'''Bal''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Boss}} that spawns every minute in {{Zone|Khazad-dûm}} if a player is nearby. Killing the boss allows the player to obtain the [[Topaz Crystal]]. 

== Spawning ==
'''Bal''' spawns every minute while a player is within {{Zone|Khazad-dûm}}, which can be found randomly generated in the lower Y levels of the [[Crystal Hollows]]. '''Bal''' will appear in the center as an expanding Magma Cube and the [[Topaz Crystal]] will disappear.

== Behavior ==
'''Bal''' will hop towards the closest player, summoning {{MobSprite|Fire Bat;Fire Bats}} and {{MobSprite|Bald Blaze;Bald Blazes}} to attack the player when hit, and shooting fireballs at an interval of once every hop. In addition, it will deal contact damage that pushes the player away like a normal {{MobSprite|Magma Cube}}, although the knockback can be avoided with a {{Stat|knockback}}-resistant item. These attacks deal low damage, with the Fire Bats and Bald Blazes ignoring the player if they have an {{Item|Intimidation Artifact}} or a {{Item|Parrot Pet}}.

When an item is dropped, there is a chance that Bal will summon {{MobSprite|Fire Bat;Fire Bats}} or {{MobSprite|Bald Blaze;Bald Blazes}}.

Upon being defeated, it will teleport to the middle and slowly shrink, before disappearing. Afterwards, the [[Topaz Crystal]] will appear nearby. It can be claimed by any player who damaged the boss until it respawns.

When alive, it makes loud slowed angry enderman sounds, which can be heard from a medium distance away.

== Drops ==
Upon every hit, '''Bal''' has a chance to drop items on the ground similar to dungeon blessings. These items will automatically collect themselves in around three minutes. Over the duration of a '''Bal''' fight, around 25-40 items will drop. These items can be: 

